WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
We ask Muse for a welcome note with exact wording and a twenty word limit.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Muse runs the saved workflow and prepares the file. A draft alone is not enough to release it.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A separate worker calls Stardive to check the actual file against the saved requirements: requested text and word count.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Both checks pass. The file arrives with a verification receipt bound to the version that was checked.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Open the receipt for the recorded steps and the checks against your request. The assurance covers only the listed checks.
